   ],
   [
    12.719,
    "And protein, as we are about to see, is a long chain built from small, repeating pieces."
   ],
   [
    18.735,
    "Those pieces are the amino acids."
   ],
   [
    21.261,
    "Today we meet them, learn their general structure, and draw the map for the whole chapter."
