    0.1,
    "Here is that plan."
   ],
   [
    1.339,
    "In the middle sits one carbon atom, the alpha carbon."
   ],
   [
    4.555,
    "That is why these are called alpha amino acids."
   ],
   [
    7.589,
    "On one side, an amino group, written N H two."
   ],
   [
